#6100
The Gap in the Hedge~
   You squeeze through the hacked gap in the hawthorn and the smell of the
camps rolls over you: smoke, sewage, sickness and too many people. Behind
you lie the Granary Fields. Ahead, a sea of tents and lean-tos stretches to
the horizon under a pall of grey smoke.
