#6112
The Sick Tents~
   Long canvas tents hold rows of pallets, and on every pallet someone is
coughing, sweating or simply lying very still. Grey blotches spread over
their skin. A single healer moves among them with a bucket and a cloth, and
her face is grey with exhaustion.
