#6114
The Burial Pits~
   Long trenches have been dug at the camp's edge, and they are filling
faster than they can be dug. Bodies wrapped in sacking lie in rows waiting
their turn. Lime is shovelled over each layer. Gravediggers work with rags
tied over their faces and will not meet your eye.
