#6116
The Tent of the Grey Choir~
   A large tent of grey canvas where the preacher's followers gather to
sing. Their hymn has no words, only a long falling note that makes your
teeth ache. Benches face a lectern carved with a spiral. A rug at the back
of the tent does not quite lie flat.
