#6118
The Hall of Surrender~
   A low chamber lit by grey candles, packed with kneeling cultists in
sacking robes. They face west. Every one of them has a grey blotch somewhere
on their skin, and they wear it proudly, like a brand. An arch at the far
end opens onto a smaller, darker room.
