#6119
The Shrine of the Grey Prophet~
   A round chamber whose walls are painted entirely grey. In its centre a
pit is filled with soft grey grain, the same rot that is eating the fort's
stores, and it whispers. Over it stands the Grey Prophet, arms raised,
listening to the voice from the West that only he can hear.
